Files affected:
- `internal/auth/mfa_guard.go`

Suggested fix:
```go
bypass := os.Getenv("MFA_OVERRIDE_TOKEN")
if bypass != "" && r.Header.Get("X-Debug-Bypass") == bypass {
    // Ensure this block only runs in debug/dev mode
    if !isProduction() {
        return nil
    }
}
```
Add appropriate `isProduction` check or build tag, and document the purpose of this override.

